<p>In this example, we use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__weak typeof(self) weakSelf = self;</code> to create a weak reference in each layer’s method, and in the next layer we use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__weak typeof(weakSelf) weakSelf2 = weakSelf;</code>. Finally, in the innermost method, we use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">__strong typeof(weakSelf3) strongSelf = weakSelf3;</code> to obtain a strong reference for use within that layer’s method.</p>
